#reward20
Sergent Fox reporting %
Radio message of General Kolman

Well done my boy, you got out of that one very well :
your eagle at hole fifteen left me voiceless ! I signed
you up for the officers tournament. Don't thank me I have
already bet a hundred credits with General Bishop you will
finish in the first five.

Right, I suggest we be done with these stupid Psychos and
the uncouth Paranos. We will confiscate four bases on their
territory in form of a sanction.

Your third armoured regiment is stationed here at Soka Bay,
I may need it to capture the Maritz base to the West.

You will leave from the town of Sakarine. To the West you
will find two bones to gnaw at, the bases of Rog and Marog.
Don't leave them time to develop, otherwise think about
writing your testament.

Anyway I hope we will both be alive to take the island of
Ekimoz, held by General Kolvitz who has a hand of steel .
His base is a detention centre where chemical Paranos
weapons are tested.

If we loose the battle, I'll let you guess who the next
guinea pigs will be.